OL,3,GNEWSASurrender bins and compensation
OL,4,Apart of plans to tackle illegal weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncils across Northern Ireland have
OL,7,Fbeen asked to install anonymous
OL,8,Fsurrender bins for a range of weapons
OL,9,Fat some of their recycling centres this
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FThe Department of Justice's (DoJ)
OL,13,FOffensive Weapon Surrender Scheme means
OL,14,Fitems such as zombie knives,
OL,15,Fknuckledusters and butterfly knives can
OL,16,Fbe disposed of safely and anonymously.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
