OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASurrender bins and compensation
OL,4,Apart of plans to tackle illegal weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile it is already illegal to posses
OL,7,Fsuch items in a public place, a new
OL,8,Flaw, as part of the Offensive Weapons
OL,9,FAct 2019, will make private possession
OL,10,Fan offence, bringing Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fin line with the rest of the UK.
OL,13,FSome councils have already agreed to
OL,14,Fthe scheme, with most still finalising
OL,15,Fdetails.
